{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43028","headline":"废长行 · 赵抟","name":"废长行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫牙镂合方如斗，二十四星衔月口。\n贵人迷此华筵中，运木手交如阵鬬。\n不算劳神运枯木，且废爲官恤惸独。\n门前有吏吓孤穷，欲诉门深抱冤哭。\n耳厌人催坐衙早，才闻此戏身先到。\n理人似爱长行心，天下安平多草草。\n何当化局爲明镜，挂在高堂辨邪正。\n何当化子作笔锋，常在手中行法令。\n莫令终日迷如此，不治生民负天子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}